Number = {1},
Pages = {81-90},
Month = {JAN-APR},
Abstract = {Today, tourism industry has a high status in the economies of the
   country and plays an active and effective role in promoting the
   economic, social and cultural structure of countries, especially in the
   developing countries. Although tourism is just one industry, tourism has
   the most cultural interactions. The tourism industry plays a major role
   in the growth process and this is where Iran has the right advantages.
   The present research which is descriptive-research, has been conducted
   using library practices and practical studies and, in addition to
   identifying strengths, examines the weaknesses of tourism growth in the
   current situation of Tabriz and the capabilities and limitations of
   tourism growth in the city and mentioned to matrix of external factors
   affecting the growth of tourism in Tabriz city. These results indicate
   the inadequacy of the urban transport system for the growth of urban
   tourism, low attention to cultural and artistic attractions, lack of
   adequate and adequate parking in the historical context, attention to
   urban furniture, as well as beatification of tourist attractions, lack
   of management and planning Suitable for tourism related issues by urban
   organizations.},
